• RT labels only on every detected peak — no guessed compound names
• Export signal / peak table  as CSV or Excel (Origin-ready)

Install:   pip install olefile matplotlib scipy openpyxl
Run:       python gcd_viewer_app.py [optional_file.gcd]
"""

